  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"ai-about-intro__lead-as0cxmc9sbla0zxy2naigenblock79bb00atuem9d\" style=\"font-family:Jost, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(45,45,45);line-height:1.85;margin:0px 0px 20px;text-align:center;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.45px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 15px;\">At Skinslé, we are <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(26,26,26);\">authorized retailers and curators</strong> of the finest clean beauty and skincare products — sourced directly from trusted manufacturers and brought to you with full quality assurance. Every product we carry is <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(26,26,26);\">100% cruelty-free, vegan-certified</strong> and never tested on animals.</p></div><div class=\"ai-about-intro__body-as0cxmc9sbla0zxy2naigenblock79bb00atuem9d\" style=\"font-family:Jost, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:rgb(107,107,107);line-height:1.9;margin:0px 0px 16px;text-align:center;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.45px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 15px;\">Skinslé was born from a simple but powerful belief — that luxury beauty should be accessible to everyone, regardless of skin tone, skin type or budget. We saw a gap in the market: too many beauty brands catered to only one type of beauty. We decided to change that.</p></div><div class=\"ai-about-intro__body-as0cxmc9sbla0zxy2naigenblock79bb00atuem9d\" style=\"font-family:Jost, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:rgb(107,107,107);line-height:1.9;margin:0px;text-align:center;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.45px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 15px;\">Today, Skinslé is home to over <strong style=\"font-weight:500;color:rgb(45,45,45);\">788 carefully selected products</strong> across lips, eyes, face, skincare, tools and men's grooming — each one handpicked for its performance, purity and the confidence it gives you when you wear it.</p></div></div></div>",
